        "description": "Identify the total heat produced by the fuel.",
        "expression": "180000 kJ"
      },
      {
        "step_number": 2,
        "description": "Calculate the calorific value by dividing total heat by the mass of the fuel.",
        "expression": "CV = \\frac{180000}{4.5}"
      }
    ],
    "final_answer": "Hence, the calorific value of the fuel is 40,000 kJ/kg.",
